> With hostile mines I practice a cycle.  Go down and fight some.  If
> possible eat some.  Then run back up the stairs and wander until fully
> healed.  Back down the stairs.  Keep cycling until the entire level is
> cleared and explored.  Then cycle at the next level.  There's no need to
