That surely works quite reliably if you can kill them fast enough or have
the stairs in a narrow area. It doesn't work in the long term if you need
too many hits and more of the creatures arrive and surround you; then you
often can't descend without risking death - which also depends on the HPs
you accumulated as a health buffer; entering mines too early in such a
case can be easily lethal.

